{"4272370":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Coal Duty","steam_appid":4272370,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4755480],"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Roadmap<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/54423aa02ebfac64c0bc71729b6c71f3.avif?t=1793116832\" width=780 height=1294 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/9f19adba67d24336f7902898b04c9aee.avif?t=1793116832\" width=780 height=80 \/><\/span><strong>The sky froze over three generations ago. The state kept the mines open.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a miner. Your number is not important. Descend with your crew, fill the cart, and come back up. <i>Most<\/i> of you will come back up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coal Duty is a 1-5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy about hitting production targets in a hole full of things that eat production teams.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Meet the Quota<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the depths to mine coal, but you don't have to report the loot you have found. Miss the quota, and the consequences follow you back. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift drops you into a freshly generated mine. Push deeper for a better haul and worse company. Tickets earned on delivery are the only currency the state recognizes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk Quietly<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat means your crew can only hear you when they are close. So can everything else. Call out a route, warn them about the thing in the tunnel, scream. The mine carries all of it equally.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Loitering<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you may enjoy your free time after hard work. Just remember who provides it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between shifts there are the barracks, the workshop, and there is also a smuggler in the restricted area. You did not hear that here.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reported Hazards<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mines are home to dozens of distinct creatures. Some are blind. Some are fast. Some look like coal until they aren't. Proceed accordingly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There Are Ways Out<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through to forbidden zones and build your escape plan between your shifts. Some miners have reportedly escaped. The state does not confirm this.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/229dedacdbcda2c0c8c1de2c59fdb5d9.avif?t=1793116832\" width=780 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 1-5 player online co-op.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate or panic over proximity voice chat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through procedurally generated mines with depth-based difficulty.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return between shifts to a persistent hub: barracks, workshop, tavern, and a smuggler in the restricted area.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape by multiple routes, toward multiple endings.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join the Union on Discord for updates!<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/9f19adba67d24336f7902898b04c9aee.avif?t=1793116832\" width=780 height=80 \/><\/span><strong>The sky froze over three generations ago. The state kept the mines open.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a miner. Your number is not important. Descend with your crew, fill the cart, and come back up. <i>Most<\/i> of you will come back up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coal Duty is a 1-5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy about hitting production targets in a hole full of things that eat production teams.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/7bec532bf0ed8d7df291f1ddd9e2df00.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Meet the Quota<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sent into the depths to mine coal, but you don't have to report the loot you have found. Miss the quota, and the consequences follow you back. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift drops you into a freshly generated mine. Push deeper for a better haul and worse company. Tickets earned on delivery are the only currency the state recognizes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/c98b4d95de0c6ab6a3bb7540623da4c6.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk Quietly<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat means your crew can only hear you when they are close. So can everything else. Call out a route, warn them about the thing in the tunnel, scream. The mine carries all of it equally.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/646a32d5bdea095b06ffce95e18ec9c7.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Loitering<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you may enjoy your free time after hard work. Just remember who provides it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between shifts there are the barracks, the workshop, and there is also a smuggler in the restricted area. You did not hear that here.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/b4acb8cfbc72e960df188a3ae4bcbaeb.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/68ec4179513eaefa4c1129a1c1633b4b.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reported Hazards<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mines are home to dozens of distinct creatures. Some are blind. Some are fast. Some look like coal until they aren't. Proceed accordingly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/69653fb3a4c7f7c96dcebf63cedf9b2e.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There Are Ways Out<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through to forbidden zones and build your escape plan between your shifts. Some miners have reportedly escaped. The state does not confirm this.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.poster.avif?t=1793116832\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.webm?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/3305bacb867f22834fc31633bfb9a1ce.mp4?t=1793116832\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/extras\/229dedacdbcda2c0c8c1de2c59fdb5d9.avif?t=1793116832\" width=780 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 1-5 player online co-op.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate or panic over proximity voice chat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through procedurally generated mines with depth-based difficulty.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return between shifts to a persistent hub: barracks, workshop, tavern, and a smuggler in the restricted area.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape by multiple routes, toward multiple endings.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join the Union on Discord for updates!<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Coal Duty is a 1-5 player co-op extraction horror-comedy. Meet the state coal quota in procedurally generated mines, spend your tickets, plan your escape. Some miners have reportedly escaped. The state does not confirm this.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/ad2720d1b70296e9370a3d6784a691b5e696f3c9\/header.jpg?t=1793116832","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/ffe143332dc313c3f19ecf700403d515bd9b156c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793116832","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4272370\/ffe143332dc313c3f19ecf700403d515bd9b156c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793116832","website":"https:\/\/corecrewgames.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and 